resources.string:
Android 13+ restricts accessibility services for sideloaded APKs by default, showing them as "Restricted Settings".

【How to Unlock:】
1. Tap "Go to App Info" below to open the system details page;
2. Tap the three dots (⋮) menu in the top-right corner;
3. Select "Allow restricted settings";
4. Verify your fingerprint or lock screen password, then accessibility will be unlocked!
